    {
      "_id": "Tv11TYdaBI7tuEj6",
      "name": "Alternate Form",
      "type": "specialAbility",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>A wererat can assume rat or hybrid form, but its gear is not absorbed into the new form. The bipedal hybrid form is about 5 feet tall, with a long tail and thin fur. The limbs are human, but the head looks like a rat’s. Changing to or from rat or hybrid form is a move action. Upon assuming either form, the wererat regains hit points as if having rested for a day. A slain wereat reverts to its humanoid form, although it remains dead. Afflicted wererats find this ability difficult to control. The rare natural wererat has full control over this power.</p>",
        "srdUrl": "https://spellbooksoftware.com/d20mrsd/urbanmonst4.html",
        "rulesPage": "Compendium.modern20.rules.JournalEntry.F9sDg5FHLKUqVnLh.JournalEntryPage.M5YY3kCExBHCkFHu",
        "source": "Urban Arcana",
        "abilityType": "supernatural",
        "sense": false,
        "activities": {}
      },
      "_key": "!actors.items!R7UbGw0MtWpcTN8T.Tv11TYdaBI7tuEj6"
    },
    {
      "_id": "kjhqnvOR6rXCxIYz",
      "name": "Rat Empathy",
      "type": "specialAbility",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>A wererat can communciate with rats in any form and gains a +4 species bonus on @Check[skill:diplomacy]{Diplomacy check}s when influencing a rat’s attitude. A friendly rat understands and heeds simple commands, such “wait,” “watch,” “flee,” and “attack.”</p>",
        "srdUrl": "https://spellbooksoftware.com/d20mrsd/urbanmonst4.html",
        "rulesPage": "Compendium.modern20.rules.JournalEntry.F9sDg5FHLKUqVnLh.JournalEntryPage.M5YY3kCExBHCkFHu",
        "source": "Urban Arcana",
        "abilityType": "extraordinary",
        "sense": false,
        "activities": {}
      },
      "_key": "!actors.items!R7UbGw0MtWpcTN8T.kjhqnvOR6rXCxIYz"
    },
    {
      "_id": "xHLK18JrSwklE2sQ",
      "name": "Skill Bonuses",
      "type": "specialAbility",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>Same as the character, with a +4 species bonus on Listen, Search, and @Check[skill:spot]{Spot check}s when in humanoid form. In rat or hybrid form, these bonuses increase to +8. A wererat in rat form also gains 3 ranks in Climb, 4 ranks in Hide, and 3 ranks in Move Silently.</p>",
        "srdUrl": "https://spellbooksoftware.com/d20mrsd/urbanmonst4.html",
        "rulesPage": "Compendium.modern20.rules.JournalEntry.F9sDg5FHLKUqVnLh.JournalEntryPage.M5YY3kCExBHCkFHu",
